OL,3,APrincess Diana's 'revenge dress' goes
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dress worn by Princess Diana to a
OL,7,Fparty in London hours after a
OL,8,Fdocumentary was televised in which the
OL,9,Fthen-Prince Charles admitted to
OL,10,Fcommitting adultery during their
OL,11,Fmarriage is going up for auction.
OL,13,FHer dramatic arrival at the Serpentine
OL,14,FGallery in 1994 in a custom-made black
OL,15,Fsilk evening dress by designer
OL,16,FChristina Stambolian became an iconic
OL,17,Fpop-culture moment.
OL,19,FThe media dubbed her outfit the
OL,20,F"revenge dress".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
